    "UHR-01–02 and IQR-01 derive the shared matrix-lattice covering bound and the isometric frame realizations of the arithmetic quotient and sublattice, while PXL-02 and IQR-02 establish self-duality of the automorphic point lattice and the archimedean base change of its orthogonal complement, nilradical and center."
